# The Rust toolchains of the workflows in .github/workflows, so a new Rust
# release on a runner image cannot fail main without a commit: clippy runs
# with pedantic and nursery denied, and each release adds lints. Each
# workflow that builds, tests, lints or formats with cargo installs the
# ones it uses with rustup and sets RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN to RUST_STABLE, so
# every cargo and rustc of the job, in the workflow and in the scripts it
# runs, uses it. RUST_NIGHTLY is only for rustfmt, since rustfmt.toml uses
# options only nightly rustfmt applies; bin/fmt.sh runs it, in the
# workflows and locally. Otherwise a local build uses whatever toolchain
# rustup or PATH selects. To bump, see docs/maintenance.md (Rust
# toolchains).
RUST_STABLE=1.99.0
RUST_NIGHTLY=nightly-2026-10-11
